stateDiagram-v2

    NEW --> RUNNING : fork/clone

    RUNNING --> SLEEP_INT : wait/sleep
    RUNNING --> SLEEP_UNINT : blocking I/O

    SLEEP_INT --> RUNNING : wakeup/signal
    SLEEP_UNINT --> RUNNING : I/O complete

    RUNNING --> STOPPED : SIGSTOP
    STOPPED --> RUNNING : SIGCONT

    RUNNING --> ZOMBIE : exit
    ZOMBIE --> DEAD : wait
